{
  "schema": "teichion.canonical-seal-record.v1.test-vectors",
  "claim_state": "REFERENCE_SERIALIZATION_ONLY",
  "notes": [
    "These vectors validate deterministic byte serialization only.",
    "The sha256 field is a fixture fingerprint, not a TEICHION seal and not an HMAC result.",
    "Cryptographic authenticity remains unimplemented at this stage."
